mall muted" id="payhub-status" hidden></p><noscript><div class="notice">Enable JavaScript for PayHub inline checkout, or use bank transfer.</div></noscript></form></div><?php else: ?><div class="notice">PayHub is not connected. Ask the administrator to enable it in Portal settings.</div><?php endif ?><?php endif ?></div></section>
